{
  "_comment": "Three routes, one install. The UserPromptSubmit event carries PROMPT routing: route_user_prompt.py asks /v1/bucket which tier the user's prompt needs, priced against the session model read off the transcript, and when a cheaper tier suffices it gives the agent Nadir's read and a pick from the worker agents in agents/ (each a fixed model and effort), and the agent decides whether to hand the work off, so routing no longer waits for the user to ask for subagents. Complex prompts add nothing. Two routes, one install. Agent events carry the BUCKET route: route-spawn.sh asks /v1/bucket which tier a spawn needs, report-outcome.sh reports what happened. The Read/Bash/SessionStart events carry COMPACTION, which is local: context_session.py makes no API and no model call, shrinking bulky tool output and large file reads before they reach the context window, with an exact archive and SHA-256 so the original is always recoverable. --no-policy is deliberate: the installer's default pins a behaviour policy at session start, and a plugin must not silently compete with Ponytail or whatever the user already runs. Anyone who wants it can run scripts/context_session.py --install-project with --policy-file instead. The Stop event carries the CACHE NUDGE: cache_miss_nudge.py reads only the usage counts of the transcript, and on a prompt-cache miss tells the user what was re-written and why; on an idle-gap miss over a large context it suggests /compact, since no hook can start compaction itself. The Stop event also closes the PROMPT route's record: route_user_prompt.py --stop posts what the turn actually ran (the main thread's model, round trips, tool calls and tokens, never text) to /v1/bucket/outcome against that prompt's decision; keyed only.",
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/route_user_prompt.py",
            "timeout": 8
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/context_session.py --state-dir \"$HOME\"/.nadir/context --max-chars 8000 --no-policy",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/route-spawn.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/context_session.py --state-dir \"$HOME\"/.nadir/context --max-chars 8000 --no-policy",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/report-outcome.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/context_session.py --state-dir \"$HOME\"/.nadir/context --max-chars 8000 --no-policy",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|clear|resume|compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/context_session.py --state-dir \"$HOME\"/.nadir/context --max-chars 8000 --no-policy",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/context_session.py --state-dir \"$HOME\"/.nadir/context --max-chars 8000 --no-policy",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/cache_miss_nudge.py --state-dir \"$HOME\"/.nadir/context",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/route_user_prompt.py --stop",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "StopFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"/scripts/route_user_prompt.py --stop",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "modules": [
    "./model_switch.ts"
  ]
}

